_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4229176290,"text":"Oh right, if he knows about the core, he can help us apply for some funding and all that stuff.","nextNodeIds":[730270405]},{"nodeId":730270405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":467442962,"text":"#But Paimon's not gonna enroll in the Akademiya or anything. You aren't planning to either, right, {NICKNAME}?","nextNodeIds":[730270409]},{"nodeId":730270409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2653439530,"text":"Anyway, we don't know what Marana's Avatar has to do with the Abyss Order yet, but it's a good thing that we cured the forest's illness all the same.","nextNodeIds":[730270410]},{"nodeId":730270410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20600,"speakerName":"Ararycan","textMapHash":1173865242,"text":"*sob* Thank you for helping Ararycan.","nextNodeIds":[730270411]},{"nodeId":730270411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2310738282,"text":"You're welcome, Ararycan.","nextNodeIds":[730270412]},{"nodeId":730270412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4288376418,"text":"So, what do you plan to do next, Ararycan?","nextNodeIds":[730270413]},{"nodeId":730270413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20600,"speakerName":"Ararycan","textMapHash":235198282,"text":"Ararycan will celebrate Festival Utsava. But Ararycan worries about the forest's illness.","nextNodeIds":[730270414]},{"nodeId":730270414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20600,"speakerName":"Ararycan","textMapHash":1886960010,"text":"There's a chance that the bad things that made the forest sick will come back. Ararycan needs to guard the forest.","nextNodeIds":[730270415]},{"nodeId":730270415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20600,"speakerName":"Ararycan","textMapHash":3215484778,"text":"So Ararycan will come back here after Festival U